    42	
    43	The report gives each question one disposition. Inspected-but-unfound source
    44	material, unavailable material, inapplicable material and explicit statements
    45	of denial remain distinguishable. Refused and empty extractor responses also
    46	have distinct outcomes. Omitted and unavailable ranges contribute zero
    47	inspected bytes, while attempted empty or refused ranges contribute their
    48	actual length. Repeated attempts each contribute their inspected length.
    49	The report includes the number of scheduled, attempted, omitted and
